## Fix that unblocks it (a code card, not this wave card)

Add the config-declared class to capture's factory list (after AutoModelForCausalLM,
before the bare AutoModel fallback), e.g. try getattr(transformers, config.architectures[0])
when it exists, and prefer a class that has .generate. Verify without a GPU: factory
